(4847926, 703686, 91663, '<td valign="top">Now normally I''m one of the few DPCers that thinks that grain can really help give an image mood. However, I think this shot would really have benefited more from a cleaner PP. This shot has some really cool colors and interesting composition, I just would have liked to see a good bit more saturation and cleanliness. 6</td>', 'Now normally I''m one of the few DPCers that thinks that grain can really help give an image mood. However, I think this shot would really have benefited more from a cleaner PP. This shot has some really cool colors and interesting composition, I just would have liked to see a good bit more saturation and cleanliness. 6', '2008-07-28 13:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4847930, 703734, 91663, '<td valign="top">Pardon me if this is a ''duh'' moment, but the image is a bit cluttered. There are some really cool shadows here, but this might have benefited from some negative space.</td>', 'Pardon me if this is a ''duh'' moment, but the image is a bit cluttered. There are some really cool shadows here, but this might have benefited from some negative space.', '2008-07-28 13:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
