(4847944, 703126, 91663, '<td valign="top">Technically great. However my problem lies in the setup--the nerd side of me notes that your "Joker" is wearing the same makeup stylings of The Joker from the recent film "The Dark Knight," but the wig is totally off--this tells me either that you lacked the wig/hair ability to pull off a proper Joker or that you''re trying to cover up a slight lack of originality on the makeup artist''s part. Either way, it''s quite inconsistent and that really hurt my enjoyment of the picture.</td>', 'Technically great. However my problem lies in the setup--the nerd side of me notes that your "Joker" is wearing the same makeup stylings of The Joker from the recent film "The Dark Knight," but the wig is totally off--this tells me either that you lacked the wig/hair ability to pull off a proper Joker or that you''re trying to cover up a slight lack of originality on the makeup artist''s part. Either way, it''s quite inconsistent and that really hurt my enjoyment of the picture.', '2008-07-28 14:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4847946, 703439, 91663, '<td valign="top">Hehe, I like the PP. It feels very Wes Anderson. Cool concept as well. I''m afraid it doesn''t match DPC''s voter trends, but I wish you the best of luck and vote you an 8.</td>', 'Hehe, I like the PP. It feels very Wes Anderson. Cool concept as well. I''m afraid it doesn''t match DPC''s voter trends, but I wish you the best of luck and vote you an 8.', '2008-07-28 14:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
