(4847968, 703533, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you had a lot of playing around with those CD''s and the lighting in order to get the refraction just right. My only critique is that I am not fond of the way the box is cut off toward the bottom of the frame. The black border makes it look like it is the bottom of the box and it looks odd because it really isn''t.</td>', 'I''ll bet you had a lot of playing around with those CD''s and the lighting in order to get the refraction just right. My only critique is that I am not fond of the way the box is cut off toward the bottom of the frame. The black border makes it look like it is the bottom of the box and it looks odd because it really isn''t.', '2008-07-28 14:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4847969, 703069, 80904, '<td valign="top">This one will win in My Opinion. Very Creative.</td>', 'This one will win in My Opinion. Very Creative.', '2008-07-28 14:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4847970, 703744, 91663, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Reminds me of the film "Science of Sleep" a bit. Childish, playful. The yellow cast over the pic is a little intense for me, but I respect the artistic decision to use it. I totally understand it would have looked weird if perfectly white balanced, but maybe just slightly less yellow would have been good. Anyway, 7.</td>', 'Sweet! Reminds me of the film "Science of Sleep" a bit. Childish, playful. The yellow cast over the pic is a little intense for me, but I respect the artistic decision to use it. I totally understand it would have looked weird if perfectly white balanced, but maybe just slightly less yellow would have been good. Anyway, 7.', '2008-07-28 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4847971, 703458, 80904, '<td valign="top">is this a kiwi family portrait? LoL Great shot nonetheless</td>', 'is this a kiwi family portrait? LoL Great shot nonetheless', '2008-07-28 14:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4847975, 703671, 80904, '<td valign="top">LoL is all I am going to say about this shot. lol</td>', 'LoL is all I am going to say about this shot. lol', '2008-07-28 14:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4847976, 703367, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. Too bad about the natural limits of depth of field. Would have been more effective if it could have been composed in layers with both parts in focus.</td>', 'Fun idea. Too bad about the natural limits of depth of field. Would have been more effective if it could have been composed in layers with both parts in focus.', '2008-07-28 14:11:28.000000', NULL, 1);
