(4848013, 702935, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very abstract indeed, because I don''t "get it", but I feel like I should. I suspect that may be what you were trying to achieve.</td>', 'Very abstract indeed, because I don''t "get it", but I feel like I should. I suspect that may be what you were trying to achieve.', '2008-07-28 14:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
