(4848024, 703536, 91663, '<td valign="top">I just imagined like some horrible parent discovering her daughter''s crack collection: "Now you are going to sit here and inject ALL of that heroin until you''ve learned your lesson!" <br/> <br/>The image is a bit too well-lit and saturated for such a serious subject. It looks like she''s just sitting down to her breakfast cereal. Not to say she doesn''t do this every morning, but "mundane" isn''t the feeling one should get from this.<br/>And, as I hinted at earlier, that IS a awful lot of drugs, just sitting in front of her as if she''s going to work her way through the box.<br/>Best of luck!</td>', 'I just imagined like some horrible parent discovering her daughter''s crack collection: "Now you are going to sit here and inject ALL of that heroin until you''ve learned your lesson!"  The image is a bit too well-lit and saturated for such a serious subject. It looks like she''s just sitting down to her breakfast cereal. Not to say she doesn''t do this every morning, but "mundane" isn''t the feeling one should get from this.And, as I hinted at earlier, that IS a awful lot of drugs, just sitting in front of her as if she''s going to work her way through the box.Best of luck!', '2008-07-28 14:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848029, 703363, 91663, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. Not the best PHOTO IMHO, a little grainy and blurry and the subject is too far to the left and cut off. But you get points for the idea.</td>', 'Very cool idea. Not the best PHOTO IMHO, a little grainy and blurry and the subject is too far to the left and cut off. But you get points for the idea.', '2008-07-28 14:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848033, 703367, 91663, '<td valign="top">Woah, cool idea. I get that it was a single shot and all, but if you could have possibly found a way to get that box in focus as well, this would have been a winner. That and reducing that shadow would help.<br/> <br/>Why didn''t you edit this? It could have been improved greatly I think.<br/> <br/>Still, 7 for it as is.</td>', 'Woah, cool idea. I get that it was a single shot and all, but if you could have possibly found a way to get that box in focus as well, this would have been a winner. That and reducing that shadow would help. Why didn''t you edit this? It could have been improved greatly I think. Still, 7 for it as is.', '2008-07-28 14:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848035, 703738, 78516, '<td valign="top">Straight out of a magazine advertisement!! Excellent!</td>', 'Straight out of a magazine advertisement!! Excellent!', '2008-07-28 14:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848042, 703717, 91663, '<td valign="top">Very cool. But I think you just hit that "overprocessed" point. Like, a single, um, processing unit, less would have made this amazing. Some weird lighting going on on her arms, and strange shadowy/halo-y things on the horizon.</td>', 'Very cool. But I think you just hit that "overprocessed" point. Like, a single, um, processing unit, less would have made this amazing. Some weird lighting going on on her arms, and strange shadowy/halo-y things on the horizon.', '2008-07-28 14:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848043, 703116, 91663, '<td valign="top">Nice! Well crafted, and I like the yellow background.</td>', 'Nice! Well crafted, and I like the yellow background.', '2008-07-28 14:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848045, 702346, 91663, '<td valign="top">Man, he looks terrified. The lighting is great, but his expression just doesn''t read ''discovery.'' This is one of those instances where the title really changes how we look at the picture--if the picture and the title don''t seem to agree, it really is detrimental to the entry.<br/>Best of luck!</td>', 'Man, he looks terrified. The lighting is great, but his expression just doesn''t read ''discovery.'' This is one of those instances where the title really changes how we look at the picture--if the picture and the title don''t seem to agree, it really is detrimental to the entry.Best of luck!', '2008-07-28 14:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
