(4849956, 703700, 53316, '<td valign="top">While I find the background busy and feel you could have edited this in a way to make it seem less flat, I love what you did with the challenge - using the box to make a photo, not being a huge in-your-face subject, but part of the photo nonetheless. I think it''s a great way to approach the challenge.</td>', 'While I find the background busy and feel you could have edited this in a way to make it seem less flat, I love what you did with the challenge - using the box to make a photo, not being a huge in-your-face subject, but part of the photo nonetheless. I think it''s a great way to approach the challenge.', '2008-07-29 20:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849958, 703738, 53316, '<td valign="top">I feel like the composition is a little too smushed up towards the top. But, it makes for an interesting feel - where I want to stare at the photo for a very long time. So overall I think the composition is not a bad thing. And of course the colors, lighting, and DOF are stunning.</td>', 'I feel like the composition is a little too smushed up towards the top. But, it makes for an interesting feel - where I want to stare at the photo for a very long time. So overall I think the composition is not a bad thing. And of course the colors, lighting, and DOF are stunning.', '2008-07-29 20:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849960, 703748, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, kinda interesting! I like the stark feel to the image.</td>', 'Wow, kinda interesting! I like the stark feel to the image.', '2008-07-29 20:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849962, 703725, 53316, '<td valign="top">Neat idea! I like it. I feel like there''s something a bit off about the way the upper left of the box on the inside, and the front corner look - maybe too blurred? Otherwise I like the image a lot.</td>', 'Neat idea! I like it. I feel like there''s something a bit off about the way the upper left of the box on the inside, and the front corner look - maybe too blurred? Otherwise I like the image a lot.', '2008-07-29 20:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849964, 703532, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is fantastic! Very different from the large number of "obviously posed" images.</td>', 'Wow, this is fantastic! Very different from the large number of "obviously posed" images.', '2008-07-29 20:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849965, 703174, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh! What a lovely piggie! I absolutely LOVE the pose as the face, being white, contrasts over the back of the body instead of visually blending in which would probably happen if the hair were all the same color. Not to mention the pose looks so curious and alert.  I had a pig and he did not get any of the plastic igloos, but boxes to play in.. so this brings back memories. And I love the addition of the hay - it makes it look as though the piggie is right at home in your photo.  I maybe wish some of the top had been cropped off - it isn''t horrible there or anything, just a bit unnecessary to me.  Oh, and another thing! Pretty good detail in the white hair and good job eliminating the red-eye problem.  And.. I like the lighting because it emphasizes the face, and it seems elegant and dramatic.  Okay, I''m rambling... I just love guinea pigs and your photo is very nice!!</td>', 'Oh! What a lovely piggie! I absolutely LOVE the pose as the face, being white, contrasts over the back of the body instead of visually blending in which would probably happen if the hair were all the same color. Not to mention the pose looks so curious and alert.  I had a pig and he did not get any of the plastic igloos, but boxes to play in.. so this brings back memories. And I love the addition of the hay - it makes it look as though the piggie is right at home in your photo.  I maybe wish some of the top had been cropped off - it isn''t horrible there or anything, just a bit unnecessary to me.  Oh, and another thing! Pretty good detail in the white hair and good job eliminating the red-eye problem.  And.. I like the lighting because it emphasizes the face, and it seems elegant and dramatic.  Okay, I''m rambling... I just love guinea pigs and your photo is very nice!!', '2008-07-29 20:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849966, 703546, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aw, cute little nose! I like the editing here... kind of like this needs to be hanging on the wall of some really chic woman''s flat or something.</td>', 'Aw, cute little nose! I like the editing here... kind of like this needs to be hanging on the wall of some really chic woman''s flat or something.', '2008-07-29 20:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849972, 703704, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very creative approach with the skull - however the subject of the cigarette box does not scream "cardboard" to me, especially with the red.  I would not say this does not meet the challenge (because I''m pretty sure that cigarette boxes *are* cardboard), however I feel that  you probably are not appealing to the challenge as much as you might. For people who aren''t spending a lot of time thinking about the entries, they might say that this doesn''t meet the challenge.  I do again want to say that I like the creative approach, and I think that this is a meaningful and emotional image.</td>', 'Very creative approach with the skull - however the subject of the cigarette box does not scream "cardboard" to me, especially with the red.  I would not say this does not meet the challenge (because I''m pretty sure that cigarette boxes *are* cardboard), however I feel that  you probably are not appealing to the challenge as much as you might. For people who aren''t spending a lot of time thinking about the entries, they might say that this doesn''t meet the challenge.  I do again want to say that I like the creative approach, and I think that this is a meaningful and emotional image.', '2008-07-29 20:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849973, 703126, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very well done! The only thing I wish is that I could see the back edge of the box - it feels a little flat as-is.</td>', 'Very well done! The only thing I wish is that I could see the back edge of the box - it feels a little flat as-is.', '2008-07-29 20:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849975, 703676, 53316, '<td valign="top">This feels maybe a little too yellow overall, but not too bad. I like the cat''s expression - definitely fits with your title!</td>', 'This feels maybe a little too yellow overall, but not too bad. I like the cat''s expression - definitely fits with your title!', '2008-07-29 20:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849978, 703533, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think this is an okay image. It definitely is very visually appealing at first glance but as I look at it a bit more there is sort of a harsh break between the sleek colors of the CDs and the textured blandness of the cardboard.  Not terrible or anything, just a little bit weird for me.</td>', 'I think this is an okay image. It definitely is very visually appealing at first glance but as I look at it a bit more there is sort of a harsh break between the sleek colors of the CDs and the textured blandness of the cardboard.  Not terrible or anything, just a little bit weird for me.', '2008-07-29 20:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849979, 703555, 53316, '<td valign="top">With a little less noise and a little more sharpness/focus/nonblur this would be so fantastic! It''s good as it is, but with less noise and such it would really stand out.</td>', 'With a little less noise and a little more sharpness/focus/nonblur this would be so fantastic! It''s good as it is, but with less noise and such it would really stand out.', '2008-07-29 20:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849983, 703751, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is very unique! I love the colors - the yellow and deep purple combination is really awesome.</td>', 'Wow, this is very unique! I love the colors - the yellow and deep purple combination is really awesome.', '2008-07-29 20:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849985, 703356, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think that this image is very oversaturated. I know what that candy box looks like and it is not that bright. That would be okay, if you wanted to brighten it, but there seem to be these little yellow dots on the table area and I think *overall* there is too much yellow. However, I DO like what you did with matching the colors of the box to the colors on the bottle. That is what I noticed first and I think it was very nicely done. So to sum up, I think the colors and color combination are good, just overall they are overpowering.</td>', 'I think that this image is very oversaturated. I know what that candy box looks like and it is not that bright. That would be okay, if you wanted to brighten it, but there seem to be these little yellow dots on the table area and I think *overall* there is too much yellow. However, I DO like what you did with matching the colors of the box to the colors on the bottle. That is what I noticed first and I think it was very nicely done. So to sum up, I think the colors and color combination are good, just overall they are overpowering.', '2008-07-29 20:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849989, 703650, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. It''s a *tiny* bit hard to see that the wings are cardboard but when I look and can see that they are, it then meets the challenge because you used a box to be creative! Didn''t say it had to stay a box.  Composition and lighting are very nice and this just seems to be a very lovely modern interpretation of the Icarus myth. Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful. It''s a *tiny* bit hard to see that the wings are cardboard but when I look and can see that they are, it then meets the challenge because you used a box to be creative! Didn''t say it had to stay a box.  Composition and lighting are very nice and this just seems to be a very lovely modern interpretation of the Icarus myth. Good job.', '2008-07-29 21:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849991, 703458, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aw, how cute! I think the image overall is a little dark but otherwise it''s very nice.</td>', 'Aw, how cute! I think the image overall is a little dark but otherwise it''s very nice.', '2008-07-29 21:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849992, 703456, 53316, '<td valign="top">I can tell they''re cardboard but not at first glance, so that might hurt your score. Lighting and details are very good and the fur has a lot of detail in it so that is very nice.</td>', 'I can tell they''re cardboard but not at first glance, so that might hurt your score. Lighting and details are very good and the fur has a lot of detail in it so that is very nice.', '2008-07-29 21:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849993, 702342, 53316, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the super-gritty feel of the image, and the space where the clothing is just seems to cut the person in half completely, but I like the idea dn composition.</td>', 'I don''t like the super-gritty feel of the image, and the space where the clothing is just seems to cut the person in half completely, but I like the idea dn composition.', '2008-07-29 21:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849994, 703507, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love it! Not only is green my favorite color (and this is a wonderful shade of green in your image) but this really does sum up my experience on this site :-D So it''s a personally meaningful image for me.</td>', 'I love it! Not only is green my favorite color (and this is a wonderful shade of green in your image) but this really does sum up my experience on this site :-D So it''s a personally meaningful image for me.', '2008-07-29 21:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
