(4849997, 703715, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like it! Very creative and emotionally meaningful. Plus the lighting is very well done in my opinion.</td>', 'Wow, I like it! Very creative and emotionally meaningful. Plus the lighting is very well done in my opinion.', '2008-07-29 21:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849999, 702892, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awwww. Love the blue eyes matched with the blue background.</td>', 'Awwww. Love the blue eyes matched with the blue background.', '2008-07-29 21:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850004, 703671, 53316, '<td valign="top">LOL! Very cute.</td>', 'LOL! Very cute.', '2008-07-29 21:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850007, 703717, 53316, '<td valign="top">I kind of like the blurry feel to the landscape. I don''t know why, but it seems more... fitting? .. I don''t know how to describe it.</td>', 'I kind of like the blurry feel to the landscape. I don''t know why, but it seems more... fitting? .. I don''t know how to describe it.', '2008-07-29 21:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850016, 703439, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love the concept. For me personally, this signifies all my burdens and how I can''t get out of carrying them, but I can allow them to be lighter.  I like your title because it does help me think of those emotional things rather than saying "oh this is just a neat image of cardboard up in the air".  I like the blue-and-yellowish processing here. The only thing that is a little bit of a problem for me is the way that the facial expression and pose are.  She seems detached from what is going on. One one hand, I can see how that fits if you want to say that she is burdened but trying to not be, or something like that. On the other hand, she still does look a bit like a slightly bored model, so that does detract from the picture for me a little bit.  But that''s not a huge deal and on the whole I really feel that this is fantastic.</td>', 'Wow! I love the concept. For me personally, this signifies all my burdens and how I can''t get out of carrying them, but I can allow them to be lighter.  I like your title because it does help me think of those emotional things rather than saying "oh this is just a neat image of cardboard up in the air".  I like the blue-and-yellowish processing here. The only thing that is a little bit of a problem for me is the way that the facial expression and pose are.  She seems detached from what is going on. One one hand, I can see how that fits if you want to say that she is burdened but trying to not be, or something like that. On the other hand, she still does look a bit like a slightly bored model, so that does detract from the picture for me a little bit.  But that''s not a huge deal and on the whole I really feel that this is fantastic.', '2008-07-29 21:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850018, 703557, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great color scheme!!</td>', 'Great color scheme!!', '2008-07-29 21:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
