(4851540, 703657, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like this, just don''t love it.  I don''t think there is anything displeasing to the eye, I just don''t say "wow!"  Maybe everything is just too subtle, things blending together too much.  Perhaps just one small shot of color...like using a dark chocolate vs. a milk chocolate, something to break the mutedness.</td>', 'I like this, just don''t love it.  I don''t think there is anything displeasing to the eye, I just don''t say "wow!"  Maybe everything is just too subtle, things blending together too much.  Perhaps just one small shot of color...like using a dark chocolate vs. a milk chocolate, something to break the mutedness.', '2008-07-30 16:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4851542, 703686, 90658, '<td valign="top">I bit too much processing for me.  Things seem really dark and the red, while standing out from the surrounding, doesn''t jump out and grab me...I''m assuming that was your intent.</td>', 'I bit too much processing for me.  Things seem really dark and the red, while standing out from the surrounding, doesn''t jump out and grab me...I''m assuming that was your intent.', '2008-07-30 16:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
