(4851556, 703532, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is visually stunning!  The lighting is wonderful and you captured the playful power within the kitty''s eyes.</td>', 'This is visually stunning!  The lighting is wonderful and you captured the playful power within the kitty''s eyes.', '2008-07-30 16:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4851566, 703000, 90658, '<td valign="top">I feel like something is missing.  Like a great book missing the last chapter.  I look at this and catch the hint at humor, but can''t find the punchline.<br/> <br/>I think I just figured it out...it needs a sign on it saying "Hollywood or Bust," or something to that end.<br/> <br/>Nice set-up though and the colors are great...way to avoid the over-processing trap.</td>', 'I feel like something is missing.  Like a great book missing the last chapter.  I look at this and catch the hint at humor, but can''t find the punchline. I think I just figured it out...it needs a sign on it saying "Hollywood or Bust," or something to that end. Nice set-up though and the colors are great...way to avoid the over-processing trap.', '2008-07-30 16:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
