(4851593, 702892, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp in presentation.  The colors all work well together and there is a sense of sophistication that is missing in some of the other animal shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice and crisp in presentation.  The colors all work well together and there is a sense of sophistication that is missing in some of the other animal shots in this challenge.', '2008-07-30 17:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
