(4854326, 703652, 65234, '<td valign="top">You''ve sent my mind off on several different tangents with this one, especially with the title.  Very nicely conceived and executed.</td>', 'You''ve sent my mind off on several different tangents with this one, especially with the title.  Very nicely conceived and executed.', '2008-08-01 00:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
