(4854333, 703310, 65234, '<td valign="top">I have a pretty big vocabulary but apparently don''t know enoug medical terms as I had to look this one up.  Very nicely done image; I would like it as an abstract even if I didn''t have a clue what it meant!</td>', 'I have a pretty big vocabulary but apparently don''t know enoug medical terms as I had to look this one up.  Very nicely done image; I would like it as an abstract even if I didn''t have a clue what it meant!', '2008-08-01 00:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854334, 703309, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro; an interesting dissection of the shapes and textures that make up a box.</td>', 'Very nice macro; an interesting dissection of the shapes and textures that make up a box.', '2008-08-01 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854337, 703738, 65234, '<td valign="top">Many women, not every woman.  But I get your point, and it is nicely shot.  It would make a great print ad.</td>', 'Many women, not every woman.  But I get your point, and it is nicely shot.  It would make a great print ad.', '2008-08-01 00:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854338, 703733, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very few dogs would sit still and model with foam peanuts on their heads!  Congrats on that; and nice job on the shot.</td>', 'Very few dogs would sit still and model with foam peanuts on their heads!  Congrats on that; and nice job on the shot.', '2008-08-01 00:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854341, 703744, 65234, '<td valign="top">What an interesting idea!  I like the cartoonish feel to it.</td>', 'What an interesting idea!  I like the cartoonish feel to it.', '2008-08-01 00:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854344, 703730, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely cat and nice perspective for "finding" her.</td>', 'Lovely cat and nice perspective for "finding" her.', '2008-08-01 00:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854347, 703703, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome; I love toads :-)  Clever idea, too.</td>', 'Awesome; I love toads :-)  Clever idea, too.', '2008-08-01 00:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854349, 703678, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, boy, that''s rather sadly emotive.</td>', 'Oh, boy, that''s rather sadly emotive.', '2008-08-01 00:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854352, 703532, 65234, '<td valign="top">The cheap toys are the best ones!  Nice light on this shot.</td>', 'The cheap toys are the best ones!  Nice light on this shot.', '2008-08-01 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854353, 703709, 65234, '<td valign="top">You got one of the bigger boxes, it looks like.  Lucky kid.  Like the DOF.</td>', 'You got one of the bigger boxes, it looks like.  Lucky kid.  Like the DOF.', '2008-08-01 01:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854438, 703277, 33068, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge.  I like it.</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge.  I like it.', '2008-08-01 01:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854447, 703349, 33068, '<td valign="top">Fun take on the challenge.  My brother is actually looking for one.</td>', 'Fun take on the challenge.  My brother is actually looking for one.', '2008-08-01 01:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854455, 702342, 33068, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, light, and texture.</td>', 'Nice framing, light, and texture.', '2008-08-01 01:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854462, 702892, 33068, '<td valign="top">I''m not a cat lover but this is adorable.  Nice lighting and the blue background really compliments their eyes.  HEHE</td>', 'I''m not a cat lover but this is adorable.  Nice lighting and the blue background really compliments their eyes.  HEHE', '2008-08-01 01:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854724, 703532, 94708, '<td valign="top">how you get the Lion to do that?</td>', 'how you get the Lion to do that?', '2008-08-01 03:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855259, 702342, 65234, '<td valign="top">Processing really suits the mood of this.  Very well done, emotive.  I like the shaft of light offering a bit of hope to the scene, but yet not reaching his face.</td>', 'Processing really suits the mood of this.  Very well done, emotive.  I like the shaft of light offering a bit of hope to the scene, but yet not reaching his face.', '2008-08-01 09:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855263, 703507, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not subtle ;-)  Nice job with the lighting, especially given the reflective surfaces and white-on-white here.</td>', 'Not subtle ;-)  Nice job with the lighting, especially given the reflective surfaces and white-on-white here.', '2008-08-01 09:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855268, 703363, 65234, '<td valign="top">Eerie eyes and hand; interesting effect.</td>', 'Eerie eyes and hand; interesting effect.', '2008-08-01 09:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855278, 703546, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed cat and s/he is lovely.  Detail on the cat is really good and I know that''s hard with dark ones.  Not sure about the overall composition; looks like it needs a different crop, maybe?  Tough to do and still make it clear it''s a box.</td>', 'Nicely framed cat and s/he is lovely.  Detail on the cat is really good and I know that''s hard with dark ones.  Not sure about the overall composition; looks like it needs a different crop, maybe?  Tough to do and still make it clear it''s a box.', '2008-08-01 09:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855298, 703458, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lambs are so sweet-looking :-)  This idea would have been fun with a wider view, too; a lamb in a box in a field would be quite an absurd sight.  But then we wouldn''t see so much of this adorable face.</td>', 'Lambs are so sweet-looking :-)  This idea would have been fun with a wider view, too; a lamb in a box in a field would be quite an absurd sight.  But then we wouldn''t see so much of this adorable face.', '2008-08-01 09:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855301, 703652, 63983, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Loved the tone and the eyes really grab you.</td>', 'Great idea. Loved the tone and the eyes really grab you.', '2008-08-01 09:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855313, 702892, 65234, '<td valign="top">All 3 holding still AND looking at the camera!  You''re good :-)<br/> <br/>Something about the background is bugging me, especially where the kitten''s furry edges are.  Like it should appear farther behind them, maybe?  The scene feels flattened back to front, I think.</td>', 'All 3 holding still AND looking at the camera!  You''re good :-) Something about the background is bugging me, especially where the kitten''s furry edges are.  Like it should appear farther behind them, maybe?  The scene feels flattened back to front, I think.', '2008-08-01 09:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855319, 703725, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not only a clever idea but the sides of the box, especially, make a surprisingly lovely candleholder with the pattern/texture of the corrugated ridges.  Kind of Zenlike simplicity and realness to it.  Nicely lit and composed, too.</td>', 'Not only a clever idea but the sides of the box, especially, make a surprisingly lovely candleholder with the pattern/texture of the corrugated ridges.  Kind of Zenlike simplicity and realness to it.  Nicely lit and composed, too.', '2008-08-01 09:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855325, 703557, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yucky title!  Soft processing suits the kitten nicely.  Wish there were a wee bit less clutter in the background; I might''ve just gone for a tighter crop.</td>', 'Yucky title!  Soft processing suits the kitten nicely.  Wish there were a wee bit less clutter in the background; I might''ve just gone for a tighter crop.', '2008-08-01 09:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855334, 702354, 65234, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable baby face with perfect detail.  Those little whiskers are fabulous :-)  I like the angle of the shot, too.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable baby face with perfect detail.  Those little whiskers are fabulous :-)  I like the angle of the shot, too.', '2008-08-01 09:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855464, 703715, 70888, '<td valign="top">this is my favorite so far in this challenge,did you do the drawings too? kudos if you did! but even if you didnt this holds my interest and is very fun to explore.i like how the girl/lady in the bottom-middle seems to stand out as he main subject and the rest are people shes somehow involved with...</td>', 'this is my favorite so far in this challenge,did you do the drawings too? kudos if you did! but even if you didnt this holds my interest and is very fun to explore.i like how the girl/lady in the bottom-middle seems to stand out as he main subject and the rest are people shes somehow involved with...', '2008-08-01 10:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855738, 703717, 62187, '<td valign="top">I imagine in telling you that of course, your photo will certainly be the top winner, it is of no ''help'' whatsoever. But, I''ll tell you that anyway. I have nothing to offer but a 10.</td>', 'I imagine in telling you that of course, your photo will certainly be the top winner, it is of no ''help'' whatsoever. But, I''ll tell you that anyway. I have nothing to offer but a 10.', '2008-08-01 11:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855752, 703367, 62187, '<td valign="top">I know we don''t vote on titles, but frankly, I hate your title: it''s like your begging the voters not to ask for a validation or something. However, I can put the title aside and vote on the photo only: 8</td>', 'I know we don''t vote on titles, but frankly, I hate your title: it''s like your begging the voters not to ask for a validation or something. However, I can put the title aside and vote on the photo only: 8', '2008-08-01 11:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855758, 702354, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a great photo but not much ''Box'' going on: 7</td>', 'It''s a great photo but not much ''Box'' going on: 7', '2008-08-01 11:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855764, 703309, 62187, '<td valign="top">Pure and simple, totally in focus and a great composition. Everything is perfect: 10</td>', 'Pure and simple, totally in focus and a great composition. Everything is perfect: 10', '2008-08-01 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855774, 703557, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like the same cat in the same challenge. This one has much more ''Box'' but still a lot of the focus seems to me to be about the cat. 8</td>', 'Looks like the same cat in the same challenge. This one has much more ''Box'' but still a lot of the focus seems to me to be about the cat. 8', '2008-08-01 11:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855777, 703748, 62187, '<td valign="top">I want this one to win: love your edit and the wide border is working for me in this photo. Nice work: 10</td>', 'I want this one to win: love your edit and the wide border is working for me in this photo. Nice work: 10', '2008-08-01 11:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855791, 702957, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, the main subject is the boy and not the box. It''s a great photo but not to hip on the frame. Anyway, I''ll give it an 8</td>', 'To me, the main subject is the boy and not the box. It''s a great photo but not to hip on the frame. Anyway, I''ll give it an 8', '2008-08-01 11:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855801, 703744, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like too much fun setting this one up. At first glace, it''s a 10 to me. But, for me, in places, it seems oversharpened and there are some white spots in the lower right that I think could have been cloned out. So, I''ll go with a still respectable 8.</td>', 'Looks like too much fun setting this one up. At first glace, it''s a 10 to me. But, for me, in places, it seems oversharpened and there are some white spots in the lower right that I think could have been cloned out. So, I''ll go with a still respectable 8.', '2008-08-01 11:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855806, 703658, 62187, '<td valign="top">As an abstract, I love it! I hope the others do too. You''ve got some stiff competition but I''ll help with a 9.</td>', 'As an abstract, I love it! I hope the others do too. You''ve got some stiff competition but I''ll help with a 9.', '2008-08-01 11:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855833, 703704, 62187, '<td valign="top">I had that Demon too: if your interested - <a href="//www.mytimetoquit.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">MyTimeToQuit.com</a>. It worked for me.</td>', 'I had that Demon too: if your interested - MyTimeToQuit.com. It worked for me.', '2008-08-01 11:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855870, 703439, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, this could have been to best of the lot. It looks like something went wrong somewhere along the line: especially with the colors. As it stands, I think a conversion to B&amp;W would have helped???? It was a GREAT!!! idea for a photo...</td>', 'To me, this could have been to best of the lot. It looks like something went wrong somewhere along the line: especially with the colors. As it stands, I think a conversion to B&W would have helped???? It was a GREAT!!! idea for a photo...', '2008-08-01 11:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855884, 703650, 62187, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and photo - kinda ''shoehornish'' using the title to make it fit in.</td>', 'Excellent idea and photo - kinda ''shoehornish'' using the title to make it fit in.', '2008-08-01 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855896, 703363, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...I love it! 10. Really, I love it and saving to favs...!</td>', 'Wow...I love it! 10. Really, I love it and saving to favs...!', '2008-08-01 11:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855938, 702704, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of a cut and paste-ish looking photo and not very realistic looking. However - it''s a wonderful effort of trying to make it look real and very creative. I can''t believe that somebody would have asked for validation. For the hassle of having to go through that, I''ll give you a 10. Plus, I love that Beatles song...!</td>', 'It''s kind of a cut and paste-ish looking photo and not very realistic looking. However - it''s a wonderful effort of trying to make it look real and very creative. I can''t believe that somebody would have asked for validation. For the hassle of having to go through that, I''ll give you a 10. Plus, I love that Beatles song...!', '2008-08-01 11:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855943, 703738, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not very helpful in telling you what you already know: it''s a perfect 10.</td>', 'Not very helpful in telling you what you already know: it''s a perfect 10.', '2008-08-01 11:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4856332, 703456, 63398, '<td valign="top">Cooperative dog! LOL!!!</td>', 'Cooperative dog! LOL!!!', '2008-08-01 13:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4856335, 703498, 63398, '<td valign="top">IMNSHO there is some real effort and time lacking in this entry......just my take, YMMV</td>', 'IMNSHO there is some real effort and time lacking in this entry......just my take, YMMV', '2008-08-01 13:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4856338, 703733, 63398, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition, great dog! 7</td>', 'Terrific composition, great dog! 7', '2008-08-01 13:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4856339, 702342, 63398, '<td valign="top">Gritty, moody, evocative.......well done! 7</td>', 'Gritty, moody, evocative.......well done! 7', '2008-08-01 13:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4856342, 703675, 63398, '<td valign="top">Kitty looks WIRED!!!!!!</td>', 'Kitty looks WIRED!!!!!!', '2008-08-01 13:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
