(4862278, 702892, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute, I could see this on a poster or calendar. The cats have a bit of a "cut and paste" feel to them, I guess you edited them separately from the background. Still a sweet photo.</td>', 'Very cute, I could see this on a poster or calendar. The cats have a bit of a "cut and paste" feel to them, I guess you edited them separately from the background. Still a sweet photo.', '2008-08-03 21:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
