(4863173, 703069, 49109, '<td valign="top">Huuuuge congrats on your blue, PB and a fantastic shot, Judi!</td>', 'Huuuuge congrats on your blue, PB and a fantastic shot, Judi!', '2008-08-04 03:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4863177, 703069, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by zackdezon:</b></div><hr/><i> One thing on the photo--I don''t quite get the two guys sprawled on the outside.<br/>8 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I would think they represent those that think/live outside the box or maybe they are just homeless? :P Anyway, great idea Judi and congrats on the PB!!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The main idea behind the two men is -<br/> <br/>1 - To deceive the viewers as to which way is up...but because of the fairy I think that became irrelevant.<br/> <br/>2 - Men seem to be seen as the ones who keep the families together in the way they provide, so having them on the outside, wrapped around signifies this.</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Originally posted by zackdezon: One thing on the photo--I don''t quite get the two guys sprawled on the outside.8   I would think they represent those that think/live outside the box or maybe they are just homeless? :P Anyway, great idea Judi and congrats on the PB!!!!   The main idea behind the two men is - 1 - To deceive the viewers as to which way is up...but because of the fairy I think that became irrelevant. 2 - Men seem to be seen as the ones who keep the families together in the way they provide, so having them on the outside, wrapped around signifies this.', '2008-08-04 04:08:09.000000', NULL, 0),
