(4863790, 703363, 53814, '<td valign="top">Thanks Karen, you are probably responsible for this - I had residual-pinhole-brain as a result of your Zone Plate entry:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=698836" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/889/120/698836.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/889/120/698836.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/889/120/698836.jpg"/></a> <br/>It was a challenge to expose this so both the hand and the box interior were recognizable - a small amount of light leakage combined with a too-large pinhole.</td>', 'Thanks Karen, you are probably responsible for this - I had residual-pinhole-brain as a result of your Zone Plate entry: It was a challenge to expose this so both the hand and the box interior were recognizable - a small amount of light leakage combined with a too-large pinhole.', '2008-08-04 11:30:52.000000', NULL, 0),
