(4866771, 703184, 40080, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tiggermo:</b></div><hr/><i> You spelled "lose" correctly!  I can''t believe how many people commented on this, that you spelled it wrong!  Excellent shot, too btw. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I misspelled the word lose with two ''o''s at first but the administrators where nice enough to correct it for me...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-05 12:31:40.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by tiggermo: You spelled "lose" correctly!  I can''t believe how many people commented on this, that you spelled it wrong!  Excellent shot, too btw.   I misspelled the word lose with two ''o''s at first but the administrators where nice enough to correct it for me...', '2008-08-05 13:30:58.000000', '2008-08-05 13:31:40.000000', 0),
(4866849, 703184, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see that your spelling did not affect your score!  A fine finish!  People point out spelling errors, but as far as I can tell, they/we don''t cut the score for them in a photography contest.  *smile*  <br/> <br/>By the way, I got a kick out of another error in your correction of the first one... you''ve asked us to "bare with you"... (take our clothes off)  *grin*   That should be "bear with you".   *grin again*<br/> <br/>I''ll be the first to say that English makes no sense whatsoever.  :)<br/> <br/>Good, fun image.  I''m glad it placed in the top ten for you.</td>', 'I''m glad to see that your spelling did not affect your score!  A fine finish!  People point out spelling errors, but as far as I can tell, they/we don''t cut the score for them in a photography contest.  *smile*   By the way, I got a kick out of another error in your correction of the first one... you''ve asked us to "bare with you"... (take our clothes off)  *grin*   That should be "bear with you".   *grin again* I''ll be the first to say that English makes no sense whatsoever.  :) Good, fun image.  I''m glad it placed in the top ten for you.', '2008-08-05 14:08:07.000000', NULL, 0),
