(4869605, 703069, 31582, '<td valign="top">At first glance I though of M.C. Escher. The guy who draws those pictures that you don''t know if your coming or going or if you up or down. Then in a blink of an eye it reminded me of the old school days with the shelves that had different toys you can take out and play with. I really like this photo because there is so many point of view that come together and make a great photo.<br/> <br/>Kudos to you my friend<br/>Deb</td>', 'At first glance I though of M.C. Escher. The guy who draws those pictures that you don''t know if your coming or going or if you up or down. Then in a blink of an eye it reminded me of the old school days with the shelves that had different toys you can take out and play with. I really like this photo because there is so many point of view that come together and make a great photo. Kudos to you my friendDeb', '2008-08-06 10:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
